    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE PAST. FACE THE DARKNESS. FIND YOUR FAMILY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an emotionally charged, third-person action-adventure where you step into the life of Sofie, a strong mother and determined college professor on a relentless journey to find her missing husband and son. In a world teetering between haunting reality and mystifying echoes of the past, Sofie confronts twisted landscapes, dangerous enemies, and secrets buried deep within her family\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a story that brings you to the edge, with a powerful narrative that unfolds as Sofie battles both physical foes and inner demons. Guided by the memories of her loved ones and her unbreakable resolve, every step Sofie takes unravels dark mysteries that push her closer to the truth \u2013 and to the choices that will ultimately shape her family\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/81e0158bfa59119690c1cd0d91fc702b.poster.avif?t=1732182322\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/81e0158bfa59119690c1cd0d91fc702b.webm?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/81e0158bfa59119690c1cd0d91fc702b.mp4?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat and Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Sofie\u2019s unique skills in fluid, visceral combat against forces lurking in the shadows. Explore stunningly crafted environments filled with clues, puzzles, and hidden lore that reveal the secrets of Sofie\u2019s world. Use tactical finesse and intuitive strategies to outwit powerful adversaries as you navigate the dangerous terrains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/3ff15af51ea31f56f03b74256e1cd947.poster.avif?t=1732182322\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/3ff15af51ea31f56f03b74256e1cd947.webm?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/3ff15af51ea31f56f03b74256e1cd947.mp4?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a universe where every detail, from Sofie\u2019s past to the world around her, is crafted to be part of a larger, expanding storyline. Discover a world where choices matter, secrets await, and echoes of the past shape the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/88dbcecf910fcff4501ef19d853de272.poster.avif?t=1732182322\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/88dbcecf910fcff4501ef19d853de272.webm?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/88dbcecf910fcff4501ef19d853de272.mp4?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a richly woven story, collecting documents, recordings, and hidden secrets that piece together the haunting past and present of Sofie\u2019s family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/6f00c9f2157f1c497365fae76d015215.poster.avif?t=1732182322\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/6f00c9f2157f1c497365fae76d015215.webm?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946320/extras/6f00c9f2157f1c497365fae76d015215.mp4?t=1732182322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Sofie: The Echoes\u2122 Today</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Sofie\u2019s journey and join a growing community of players captivated by a story-rich experience with cinematic gameplay and unforgettable characters. Add <i>Sofie: The Echoes\u2122</i> to your Wishlist now to stay updated on  the journey towards launch.</p>",
